-- ADR-0056 decision 3 item 2, security review L1 of the console lot: the scan job whose items
-- `findings.altered` holds, so a late batch of an older job adds to the parts a newer job reported
-- instead of replacing them (fail closed). Generated by drizzle-kit. A nullable column without a
-- default, a constraint or a foreign key: a catalog-only change on `findings`, which may be large,
-- nothing to validate (AGENTS.md, ADR-0028). Rows written before it fall back to `last_job_id`.
ALTER TABLE "findings" ADD COLUMN "altered_job_id" uuid;